{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21011","headline":"送韦仁实兄弟入关 · 李贺","name":"送韦仁实兄弟入关","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"送客饮别酒，千觞无赭颜。\n何物最伤心，马首鸣金鐶。\n野色浩无主，秋明空旷间。\n坐来壮胆破，断目不能看。\n行槐引西道，青梢长攒攒。\n韦郎好兄弟，叠玉生文翰。\n我在山上舍，一亩蒿硗田。\n夜雨呌租吏，春声暗交关。\n谁解念劳劳，苍突唯南山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21011.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21011","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}